{'symbol': 'BAC', 'date': '2022-10-20 08:00:00', 'title': 'BANK OF AMERICA CELEBRATES CLIENTS WITH MORE REWARDS DAY ON SATURDAY, NOVEMBER 5TH', 'text': 'BANK OF AMERICA CONSUMER AND SMALL BUSINESS CREDIT CARDHOLDERS WILL AUTOMATICALLY EARN EXTRA CASH BACK, MILES OR POINTS TO KICK OFF HOLIDAY SEASON CHARLOTTE, N.C. , OCT. 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ON SATURDAY, NOVEMBER 5 TH, BANK OF AMERICA WILL INTRODUCE ITS FIRST-EVER MORE REWARDS DAY \xa0– A ONE-DAY CELEBRATION GIVING BANK OF AMERICA CONSUMER AND SMALL BUSINESS CARDHOLDERS THE OPPORTUNITY TO EARN BONUS REWARDS FOR ALL THE PURCHASES THEY MAKE WITH A BANK OF AMERICA CREDIT CARD ON THAT DAY.'}